# Joul AI Call Answering - Claude Code Configuration

**Project:** Joul AI Automation
**Purpose:** AI-powered missed call answering service
**Claude Code Skills & Resources:** Pre-configured for call handling workflows

---

## 🎯 Purpose & Goals

This project uses Claude Code to:
- **Intercept missed calls** and voicemail messages
- **Analyze caller context** and intent
- **Generate intelligent responses** (emails, callbacks, SMS, escalations)
- **Remember caller history** and preferences
- **Notify team members** of important calls
- **Track quality metrics** and improvements

---

## 📞 Key Skills & Integrations

### Voice Processing
```bash
# Install voice transcription
npx skills add github:vimalk78/dictate
```
- Offline, private voice-to-text via faster-whisper
- No cloud APIs, all processing local
- Transcribes voicemail and call recordings

### Memory Management
```bash
# Install call history memory
npx skills add github:lukaszraczylo/claude-mnemonic
```
- Remembers caller information
- Tracks previous interactions
- Learns preferences and patterns

### Notifications & Alerts
```bash
# Install notification system
npx skills add github:DevinoSolutions/ai-agent-notifier
```
- Push notifications to team members
- Desktop and mobile alerts
- Zero-dependency, cross-platform

### Agent Orchestration
```bash
# Install multi-agent collaboration
npx skills add github:WenyuChiou/agent-collab-skills
```
- Task routing and splitting
- Output reconciliation
- Shared memory across agents

### Observability & Monitoring
```bash
# Install agent monitoring
npx skills add github:hoangsonww/Claude-Code-Agent-Monitor
```
- Real-time call processing dashboard
- Tool usage tracking
- Session performance metrics

