## 📊 Workflow: Incoming Call → AI Response

```
1. DETECT: Webhook receives missed call notification
   ├─ Extract: Caller ID, time, voicemail content
   └─ Context: Look up caller in memory (joul-mnemonic)

2. PROCESS: Claude agent analyzes call
   ├─ Agent 1: Transcribe voicemail (dictate)
   ├─ Agent 2: Classify intent & sentiment
   ├─ Agent 3: Generate response options
   └─ Agent 4: Execute chosen action

3. RESPOND: Send appropriate response
   ├─ Email summary to company
   ├─ SMS to caller (if enabled)
   ├─ Slack notification to team
   └─ Escalate if needed

4. TRACK: Log everything
   ├─ Save to memory (caller preferences learned)
   ├─ Update observability dashboard
   ├─ Calculate quality metrics
   └─ Notify team of outcomes
```

