## 🛠️ Configuration

### Enable Agent Memory
Set in Claude Code settings:
```json
{
  "context_type": "persistent",
  "memory_backend": "mnemonic",
  "call_history_retention": "6_months"
}
```

### Configure Notifications
```json
{
  "notifications": {
    "important_calls": "push",
    "escalations": "push + slack",
    "all_calls": "log_only"
  }
}
```

### Set Up Observability
```json
{
  "observability": {
    "dashboard_url": "http://localhost:3000",
    "track_metrics": [
      "call_count",
      "response_time",
      "accuracy_score",
      "cost_per_call"
    ]
  }
}
```

