## 🚨 Important Notes

### Privacy & Security
- ✅ All voice processing happens locally (offline)
- ✅ No transcripts sent to external services
- ✅ Caller information encrypted in memory
- ✅ Access logs tracked via observability stack

### Performance Considerations
- Voice transcription: ~2-5 seconds per minute of audio
- Agent response time: ~5-15 seconds
- Memory lookups: <100ms with caching
- Monitor dashboard: Real-time with <1s latency

### Cost Optimization
- Use token counting to track API usage
- Batch similar calls for efficiency
- Cache common responses
- Monitor cost per call via observability stack

