## 📞 Quick Reference: Phone System Integration

Your phone system should POST to Claude Code webhook:

```json
{
  "event": "missed_call",
  "caller_id": "+1234567890",
  "timestamp": "2026-10-03T14:35:00Z",
  "voicemail_url": "https://voicemail-storage/abc123.wav",
  "caller_name": "John Doe"  // optional
}
```

Claude will:
1. Fetch voicemail audio
2. Transcribe locally
3. Look up caller history
4. Generate response
5. POST response back to your system

